WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:07.370
Our story doesn't begin in the Lands Between;
it begins in the cosmos, far away with an

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:10.680
Outer God called "The Greater Will".

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.440
There are..a lot of Outer Gods mentioned in
Elden Ring (Note: At least 6, maybe more).

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:20.900
You can think of these kind of like the Great
Ones of Bloodborne - distant beings..all powerful..and

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.949
quite unknowable, by design.

00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:28.970
Many of these Outer Gods want to make their
presence felt in the world..The Greater Will

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:30.539
maybe most of all.

00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:35.270
To this end, it sent a golden star hurtling
towards the Lands Between.

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:40.390
The Elden Stars incantation tells us that
this golden star was bearing a beast.

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:41.890
An Elden Beast.

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:45.980
The Elden Remembrance calls it a "vassal beast
of the Greater Will".

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:51.030
If you didn't know, a "vassal" is someone
who holds land on behalf of their overlord.

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:56.530
Obviously this is fitting in this case, because
the Elden Beast was an extension of the Greater

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.940
Will and a "living incarnation of the concept
of order" in the Lands Between.

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:06.299
As such, this beast would later become ... the
Elden Ring (Elden Remembrance).

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:09.929
The Elden Ring itself is made up of runes
of power.

00:01:09.929 --> 00:01:15.549
Some Great, some small, that together represent
a sort of logic for the world to follow (inferred

00:01:15.549 --> 00:01:16.549
by what follows).

00:01:16.549 --> 00:01:18.710
Thus, the Elden Ring represents order.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:23.729
The true nature of this order is a subject
of constant debate and research undergone

00:01:23.729 --> 00:01:30.030
by fundamentalists..but two of the key fundamentals
are the laws of causality and regression.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:35.689
You can think of the Law of Causality as cause
and effect, where actions have consequences

00:01:35.689 --> 00:01:41.220
and those consequences are new causes that
"branch" out into infinity.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:44.420
These are the relationships between things.

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:50.139
Then there's the Law of Regression, that states
that all things eternally yearn to converge,

00:01:50.139 --> 00:01:52.859
and return to their roots.

00:01:52.859 --> 00:01:59.079
Fittingly then, the Elden Ring is housed within
the Erdtree, which towers over the Lands Between.

00:01:59.079 --> 00:02:04.679
But it's very important to stress that life
in the Lands Between did not begin WITH the

00:02:04.679 --> 00:02:06.960
Erdtree, the Elden Ring, or the Elden Beast.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:11.250
No..the Lands Between were occupied well before
the Greater Will came.

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:13.880
There were other beings here (Deathbird descriptions,
Giant Descriptions)..there were other factions

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.900
here (carians, giants)..there were other Gods
here (One-Eyed Shield, Twinbird Kite Shield).

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:22.410
There was even..another Great Tree here, before
the Erdtree.

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:26.430
And this is where a huge twist regarding the
Erdtree comes in.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:31.790
So, there are incantations in the game called
"Aspects of the Crucible".

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:37.010
According to their descriptions, these are
"manifestations of the Erdtree's primal vital

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:43.120
energies", and I quote - they are "an aspect
of the primordial crucible, where all life

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.290
was once blended together".

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:50.810
But how could ALL life be blended together
in the Erdtree, if the Erdtree appeared AFTER

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:51.810
life existed?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:54.550
Well, there can only be one answer, right?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:59.370
That the Erdtree is a parasite and took over
a tree that existed here before (Crucible

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:00.370
Tree Helm).

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:02.020
This tree was called..the Great Tree.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:06.440
Root resin is secreted from the roots of the
great tree, and reads: "The roots of the Greattree

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:07.440
were once linked to those of the Erdtree."

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.440
(Theory: This connection might have been severed
due to deathroot)

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:11.700
So the Great Tree was a crucible of life itself,
and must have been a very powerful primordial

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:14.310
force for the Greater Will to commandeer.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:19.060
It might even be the reason the Lands Between
is important to the Greater Will in the first

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:20.060
place.

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.770
It also explains why spells and enemies (see:
omen, misbegotten, crucible knights) related

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:26.540
to the Great Tree's crucible would eventually
be looked down upon.

00:03:26.540 --> 00:03:32.270
For example, the Knot Talisman is fashioned
from a knotted vestige of the crucible, and

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:37.300
it "was considered a signifier of the divine
in ancient times, but is now increasingly

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:41.770
disdained as an impurity as civilization has
advanced."

00:03:41.770 --> 00:03:46.090
Enemies related to the Great Tree's crucible
are the Omen ... the Misbegotten ... and the

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:47.340
Crucible Knights.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:51.550
All of them would become shunned, enslaved,
or imprisoned.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:56.590
Those who speak for the Erdtree ... don't
want you to know its roots, so to speak.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:00.390
According to the spell "Protection of the
Erdtree", "In the beginning, everything was

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:05.150
in opposition to the Erdtree, but through
countless victories in war, it became the

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.060
embodiment of Order".

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:11.450
In Marika's own words: The Erdtree governs
all.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:13.950
The choice is thine.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.630
Become one with the Order.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:20.680
Or divest thyself of it.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:24.940
To wallow at the fringes; a powerless upstart.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:32.310
To enforce order, the Greater Will required
loyal agents in the Lands Between.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:36.350
To this end, the Two Fingers are its envoys
(Enia dialogue).

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:43.680
The Two Fingers Heirloom reads: Of course,
fingers cannot speak, yet these are eloquent.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:47.960
Persistently they wriggle, spelling out mysteries
in the air.

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.520
Thus did we gain the words.

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:51.710
The words of our faith".

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:55.520
These "words" are interpreted by the Finger
Readers.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:05:00.230
These are the undying (Talisman Pouch) old
crones found throughout the lands between,

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.290
who pass down the wisdom of the Two Fingers.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:04.690
Or at least, they used to.

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:08.470
// who tell you random bullshit that makes
no sense and take up precious NPC markers

00:05:08.470 --> 00:05:09.470
on your map

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:11.930
Your fingers..please, I can read them.

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:18.620
Most of them appear to have lost their purpose,
and are desperate to read your fingers since

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.860
their Two Fingers..are likely dead.

00:05:20.860 --> 00:05:24.060
And yes, of course - there are multiple sets
of Two Fingers.

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:28.070
You would have found their corpses on the
tops of the Divine Towers.

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:32.491
Atop these towers, you loot the fingers in
order to activate the true power of a Great

00:05:32.491 --> 00:05:33.491
Rune.

00:05:33.491 --> 00:05:37.570
Specifically, you are giving "benediction"
back to your Great Rune (Unactivated Great

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.570
Rune description).

00:05:38.570 --> 00:05:41.800
You're taking a blessing back from the dead
Two Fingers, essentially.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:45.220
This is just one of many blessings that the
Two Fingers can bestow (Shadows, Eternal Life

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:50.360
to the Finger Readers)..and my point is - the
Two Fingers clearly have more than just influence.

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:52.060
They have real power.

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.060
(NOTE: This is further evidenced during Ranni's
questline, who goes to great lengths to slay

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:54.060
her own pair of fingers.)

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:59.010
The Greater Will needs these powerful envoys
and agents because while it's obviously incredibly

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:01.330
powerful, it does seem limited by a few things.

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:02.730
First, is space.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:07.210
The Greater Will didn't come to the Lands
Between itself - it sent an Elden Beast to

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.990
do its bidding instead.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:10.820
Second, is time.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:16.330
There is a moment, later in the game, where
your pair of Two Fingers go still, forced

00:06:16.330 --> 00:06:19.360
to consult the Greater Will for guidance.

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:25.820
"When they are finished, the Fingers will
again offer their guidance.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:32.940
But thousands, if not tens of thousands, of
moons must first pass.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:35.220
No matter for me.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:36.360
But you?

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:40.350
How will you ever manage the wait..."

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:46.449
So the Greater Will needs a physical manifestation
of order..it needs envoys to convey its will..but

00:06:46.449 --> 00:06:49.249
what it also needs.. is a god.

00:06:49.249 --> 00:06:50.249
---

00:06:50.249 --> 00:06:51.870
Introducing..Marika, the Eternal.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:59.520
Most of the story of Elden Ring relates to
Marika in some way - she's essentially the

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.260
equivalent of Gwyn, from Dark Souls.

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:08.130
Except, unlike Gwyn, Marika didn't just crawl
out of the dark and find power..to an extent,

00:07:08.130 --> 00:07:10.460
it seems like she earned it.

00:07:10.460 --> 00:07:15.060
We don't know much about her origins, except
that she is of the "Numen" race, which is

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.940
actually an origin you can choose in the character
selection screen.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:24.510
"Numen come from outside of the Lands Between,
and are supposed descendants of denizens of

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:25.790
another world.

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.169
Long-lived, but seldom born".

00:07:28.169 --> 00:07:32.210
At some point, Marika was chosen as an Empyrean.

00:07:32.210 --> 00:07:33.370
What is an empyrean?

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:37.090
An empyrean is a being "chosen by the fingers"
(Black Flame Ritual Incantation and Ranni

00:07:37.090 --> 00:07:39.020
Dialogue) as a candidate for godhood (Ranni
dialogue).

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:44.190
As an empyrean, Marika received the aid of
a Shadow, to do her bidding.

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:45.190
So what is a Shadow?

00:07:45.190 --> 00:07:50.550
- well, it's a wolf, shadowbound to its empyrean
by the Two Fingers (Iji Dialogue, Raging Wolf

00:07:50.550 --> 00:07:51.550
Set).

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:56.880
Lunar Princess Ranni is another example of
an empyrean with a shadowbound beast.

00:07:56.880 --> 00:08:02.419
These creatures are the empyrean's very own
shadow - completely loyal to their needs,

00:08:02.419 --> 00:08:05.960
and by definition, incapable of treachery.

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:09.470
Marika's shadow was a beast called Maliketh.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:14.680
Every empyrean uses their shadow in different
ways, but "Marika's sole need of her shadow

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:18.660
was a vessel to lock away Destined Death"
(Remembrance of the Black Blade).

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:20.810
So..what is Destined Death?

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:24.560
Well according to Enia - it's the Rune of
Death.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:31.970
The Rune of Death goes by two names; the other
is Destined Death.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:37.440
We mentioned earlier that the Elden Ring is
made up of runes - and at some point - maybe

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:42.919
when she was chosen as god, Marika plucked
the Rune of Death from the Elden Ring (Enia

00:08:42.919 --> 00:08:43.919
Dialogue).

00:08:43.919 --> 00:08:49.800
She gave the Rune of Death to Maliketh, her
totally loyal shadow - who bore a Black Blade

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.270
imbued with this rune (Maliketh's Armour).

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:53.399
Kind of genius, really.

00:08:53.399 --> 00:08:59.149
In a single act, she removed the concept of
death from the Lands Between..while also commanding

00:08:59.149 --> 00:09:06.520
total control of death through her shadow,
who could deliver it at her whim.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.430
Now some of you might be asking - if death
is removed from the Lands Between, how come

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:12.980
I can kill this dog?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:15.060
First off, shame on you.

00:09:15.060 --> 00:09:19.610
Second - from a lore point of view, that dog
isn't really dead..it's simply in the process

00:09:19.610 --> 00:09:24.390
of its spirit..or its soul ( D dialogue),
returning to the erdtree.

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:29.810
Catacomb dungeons are specifically constructed
near the roots of the Greattree for this reason,

00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:34.279
so that the Erdtree can reabsorb their ashes
back into it (Root Resin).

00:09:34.279 --> 00:09:39.089
This process replaced the concept of a death
you were "destined" to have.

00:09:39.089 --> 00:09:43.360
But this random spirit outside a catacomb
dungeon says it best.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:49.050
A proper death means returning to the Erdtree.

00:09:49.050 --> 00:09:50.050
Have patience.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.050
Until the time comes...and the roots call
to you.

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:53.640
As another example - when you kill a major
boss, you receive a "remembrance" of them.

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:57.200
These are spirits (Godfrey apparition fight),
"hewn into the Erdtree".

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:02.810
In this way, thanks to the Erdtree's grace..their
spirits are immortalised..

00:10:02.810 --> 00:10:07.311
This new form of death also explains what's
happening when you summon spirits from ash.

00:10:07.311 --> 00:10:08.311
Tis a bell for calling forth spirits.

00:10:08.311 --> 00:10:09.820
Summon them with it, from ash unreturned to
the Erdtree.

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:15.820
However, some spirits never return to the
Erdtree, and rise within death as corpses

00:10:15.820 --> 00:10:16.980
or skeletons instead.

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:21.380
(NOTE: This is partly because of Deathroot,
which we will address in another video)

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:22.380
Unthinkable.

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:23.590
Our hallowed resting place is violated.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:24.590
To refuse the Erdtree's call to return, to
live within Death...

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:25.590
Sickening.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:26.590
---

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:27.590
So this was the new order.

00:10:27.590 --> 00:10:28.590
The Golden Order.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:30.190
And it's important to stress that it was in
THIS moment - when the Rune of Death was removed..when

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:33.600
Destined Death was taken - THIS is when Order..

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:35.320
became the Golden Order.

00:10:35.320 --> 00:10:41.520
The forbidden shadow plucked from the Golden
Order upon its creation.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:44.310
Specifically, this was Marika's Golden Order.

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:49.640
So not only did she become a god and a vessel
for the Elden Ring (Enia dialogue)..she became

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:56.950
renowned as "Marika the Eternal" for her removal
of Destined Death.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:01.770
However..Marika had more than just death to
conquer.

00:11:01.770 --> 00:11:07.770
She had wars to fight, as the world was occupied
by many forces that could threaten her Golden

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:08.930
Order.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:12.780
There was war with the Storm Lord, who likely
ruled over Stormveil..

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:16.960
There was a war with the giants, who were
masters of a flame that could burn the Erdtree..

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:21.130
There was a war with the Ancient Dragons,
who incidentally had stones that could twist

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:23.350
time, and thus slay a god..

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:28.649
And finally, there was war brewing with the
Carian Royalty, who had previously "obeyed

00:11:28.649 --> 00:11:32.330
laws which contravened the Golden Order" (Corhyn
dialogue).

00:11:32.330 --> 00:11:38.780
Thus, similar to how the Greater Will needed
an empyrean to enforce its will..Marika needed

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.589
someone to wage war.

00:11:40.589 --> 00:11:42.760
So, there was to be a husband.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:43.860
A consort.

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:46.220
An Elden Lord.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:50.510
The man chosen was Hoarah Loux - a ferocious
warrior (Godfrey Icon) who became known as

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:52.350
the Lord of the Battlefield (Elden Lord Armor).

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:56.150
His crown was "warranted with strength" (Axe
of Godfrey), and while it was for this strength

00:11:56.150 --> 00:12:02.290
that Marika married him - he was also required
to take a "vow to conduct himself as a lord"

00:12:02.290 --> 00:12:03.290
(Axe of Godfrey).

00:12:03.290 --> 00:12:07.959
To suppress the ceaseless lust for battle
that raged within, Hoarah Loux took the Beast

00:12:07.959 --> 00:12:10.610
Regent Serosh upon his back.

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:13.820
You'll notice this is yet another example
of a beast being given for the purpose of

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.110
serving Order.

00:12:15.110 --> 00:12:21.070
Thus, in this moment, he went from being Hoarah
Loux, warrior - to Godfrey..the First Elden

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:24.670
Lord (source: His reversion in the boss cutscene),
consort to Queen Marika, and a certified demi-god

00:12:24.670 --> 00:12:26.160
(source: Godrick's Great Rune).

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.730
Godfrey and Marika had..at least three demi-god
children together.

00:12:29.730 --> 00:12:34.680
There was Godwyn the Golden, who you saw being
killed in the opening trailer, and then there

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:41.180
were the reviled Omen twins: Morgott, who
guards the Erdtree..and Mohg, who became Lord

00:12:41.180 --> 00:12:42.360
of Blood.

00:12:42.360 --> 00:12:47.170
You might think Godrick was another demi-god
child - but he was not.

00:12:47.170 --> 00:12:49.430
Instead, he was probably descended from Godwyn.

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.430
Godrick the Grafted was but a distant relation.

00:12:50.430 --> 00:12:51.430
The runt of the litter, his divine blood sorely
diluted.

00:12:51.430 --> 00:12:54.560
Anwyay, we'll talk about these demi-gods more
in detail in another video, so subscribe for

00:12:54.560 --> 00:13:00.080
that - but for now, just know that Godfrey
and his offspring were the first demi-gods

00:13:00.080 --> 00:13:05.680
(Godrick's Great Rune")...henceforth known
as the Golden Lineage.

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:10.240
Godfrey led the 16 (Crucible Axe Set) Crucible
Knights into battle, who were named so for

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:15.050
they fought with the primordial powers of
the Erdtree - their incantations were aspects

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:22.279
of its crucible, and they (likely) fought
Giants, Dragons, Storm Lords and more - to

00:13:22.279 --> 00:13:25.960
usher in their age - the Age of the Erdtree.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:29.040
Hark, brave warriors.

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:33.160
Hark, my lord Godfrey.

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.870
We commend your deeds.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:41.430
Guidance hath delivered ye through each ordeal,
to the place ye stand.

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:48.140
Put the Giants to the sword, and confine the
flame atop the mount.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.780
Let a new epoch begin.

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:53.430
An epoch glistening with life.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:58.710
Brandish the Elden Ring, for the Age of the
Erdtree!

00:13:58.710 --> 00:14:03.231
The Erdtree would go on to largely be seen
as a blessing for all those in the Lands Between

00:14:03.231 --> 00:14:08.110
- especially those close to it in Llendell,
the Capital City of the Erdtree.

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:13.260
The tree bestowed blessings, for example - the
tears that dripped from its branches like

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.260
jewels (tear descriptions).

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:20.010
It loomed overhead as a constant reminder
of order, and its roots reached far and wide,

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:23.481
relieving many of the burden of death (roots
in the catacombs).

00:14:23.481 --> 00:14:27.970
In fact, Erdtree Burial was one of the highest
honours a hero could receive (assorted spirit

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:28.970
ash descriptions).

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:29.970
---

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.250
One by one, the previous factions of the world
fell.

00:14:31.250 --> 00:14:32.253
Stormveil was conquered, and the Storm Lord
was defeated.

00:14:32.253 --> 00:14:36.750
The giants were put to the sword (Marika Dialogue),
and their Fell God was killed by Marika herself.

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:41.790
The Ancient Dragons broke down the walls of
Lleyndell, but met fierce retaliation (Elden

00:14:41.790 --> 00:14:42.790
Lord Armor)..

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:43.790
However..

00:14:43.790 --> 00:14:47.800
I think the House of the Erdtree encountered
the most trouble against the land to their

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:48.800
southwest.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:49.800
Liurnia.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:55.660
Here, the House of the Moon repelled their
offensives time and time again - for there

00:14:55.660 --> 00:15:01.800
was not one, but two wars over this territory..and
in these, there was no victory for the golden,

00:15:01.800 --> 00:15:02.800
nor for the moon.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:03.800
(Sword Gravestone Lore x2).

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:07.170
Now I suspect..it was because of the lobsters.

00:15:07.170 --> 00:15:10.829
These damn things can snipe you from like
a mile away Miyazaki come on this is BULLSH-

00:15:10.829 --> 00:15:15.269
Actually, it was probably because of the Carian
Knights, who, according to their weapons,

00:15:15.269 --> 00:15:20.410
were able to wield sorcerous battle skills,
and "despite numbering fewer than twenty,

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:24.670
this power made them a match for even the
champions of gold, in battle (Carian Knight's

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.670
Sword)."

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:26.670
Yes, glintstone pebble is that powerful.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:29.320
These enchanted knights were anointed by the
Lunar Queen, a young astrologer (Stargazer

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:34.399
Heirloom) who went on to establish the House
of Caria as royalty in this land.

00:15:34.399 --> 00:15:39.640
With her bewitching lunar magic, she won over
the Academy of Raya Lucaria where glintstone

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:46.139
sorcery was studied, and - united - the Carian
Royal Family and the learned sorcerers of

00:15:46.139 --> 00:15:50.240
Raya Lucaria defended their home from the
golden aggressors.

00:15:50.240 --> 00:15:55.240
At the head of the great golden host, was
Radagon.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:59.850
Lord Radagon was a great champion, possessed
of flowing red locks.

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:08.399
He came to these lands at the head of a great
golden host, when he met Lady Rennala in battle.

00:16:08.399 --> 00:16:13.420
These two champions clashed, fell in love,
and joined their houses.

00:16:13.420 --> 00:16:17.440
Radagon once cleansed himself with celestial
dew,

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:22.980
repented his territorial aggressions, and
swore his love to Rennala.

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:29.500
The Order of the Erdtree and the fate of the
moon were conjoined, and all the wounds of

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:31.550
war forgiven.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:36.700
You might think it strange that the Greater
Will would permit this union - but it's not

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:38.760
too odd, all things considered.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:44.579
As with most From Software games, sorcery
and faith are two sides of the same coin - and

00:16:44.579 --> 00:16:46.930
both of these powers stem from the cosmos.

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:47.930
In the past, they obeyed laws which contravened
the Golden Order, or so I'm told.

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:48.930
Fascinating, isn't it?

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:49.930
That the Golden Order was pliable enough to
absorb practices that contradicted itself

00:16:49.930 --> 00:16:50.930
in the past.

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:53.089
Radagon and Rennala were known to have had
three children together.

00:16:53.089 --> 00:16:58.450
Lunar Princess Ranni, who inherited her mother's
propensity for Lunar magic (Ranni's Dark Moon).

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:04.040
Radahn, who took after his father Radagon,
and would go on to master gravitational magic...and

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:10.520
Rykard..who pioneered new hex sorceries, and
would go on to feed himself to a great serpent.

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:11.751
(remembrance of the blasphemous)

00:17:11.751 --> 00:17:12.751
---

00:17:12.751 --> 00:17:16.500
It follows that at some point after all of
this, Marika began to harbour doubts.

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:24.179
Doubts about the Golden Order she had had
a hand in creating.

00:17:24.179 --> 00:17:29.530
I declare mine intent, to search the depths
of the Golden Order.

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:37.100
Through understanding of the proper way, our
faith, our grace, is increased.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:41.490
Those blissful early days of blind belief
are long past.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:46.500
My comrades; why must ye falter?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.720
It's at this point that we should talk about
Marika's motivations.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.370
Her character.

00:17:51.370 --> 00:17:57.710
This is surely going to be a point of debate
in the coming years, but for now..my working

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:03.840
theory is that she wanted to discover the
truth behind Order and the Greater Will.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:10.460
That she believed bonds had to be broken,
so that they could be better understood.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:14.380
That there was great meaning to be found..
in hardship.

00:18:14.380 --> 00:18:16.470
Queen Marika has high hopes for us.

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:19.240
That we continue to struggle.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.960
Unto eternity.

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:26.270
For Lord Godfrey, his struggle ended at the
end of his campaigns.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:29.510
According to his armour - "He led the War
against the Giants.

00:18:29.510 --> 00:18:31.590
Faced the Storm Lord, alone.

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.559
And then, there came a moment.

00:18:33.559 --> 00:18:35.870
When his last worthy enemy fell.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:41.130
And it was then, as the story is told, that
the hue of Lord Godfrey's eyes faded."

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:44.200
In truth, he was robbed of his grace (Remembrance
of Hoarah Loux).

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:46.440
Then Marika sent him away.

00:18:46.440 --> 00:18:50.020
My Lord, and thy warriors.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:54.650
I divest each of thee of thy grace.

00:18:54.650 --> 00:19:00.120
With thine eyes dimmed, ye will be driven
from the Lands Between.

00:19:00.120 --> 00:19:08.710
Ye will wage war in a land afar, where ye
will live, and die.

00:19:08.710 --> 00:19:17.910
This became known as the Long March of the
Tarnished.

00:19:17.910 --> 00:19:21.330
But Queen Marika had a plan.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:26.700
That Lord Godfrey and their tarnished descendants
would one day return stronger, having struggled

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:27.970
outside of grace.

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:35.299
Then, after thy death, I will give back what
I once claimed.

00:19:35.299 --> 00:19:42.210
Return to the Lands Between, wage war, and
brandish the Elden Ring.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:45.360
Grow strong in the face of death.

00:19:45.360 --> 00:19:48.920
Warriors of my lord.

00:19:48.920 --> 00:19:49.920
Lord Godfrey.

00:19:49.920 --> 00:19:50.920
---

00:19:50.920 --> 00:19:52.710
Soon after, she found a new husband.

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:56.190
Either that, or a new husband was found for
her.

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:03.500
when Godfrey, first Elden Lord, was hounded
from the Lands Between, Radagon left Rennala

00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:11.730
to return to the Erdtree Capital, becoming
Queen Marika's second husband and King Consort,

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:15.900
taking the title...of second Elden Lord.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.900
The mystery endures, to this day...

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:26.480
As to why Lord Radagon would cast Lady Rennala
aside... and moreover...why a mere champion

00:20:26.480 --> 00:20:30.650
would be chosen for the seat of Elden Lord".

00:20:30.650 --> 00:20:36.370
Whatever the case - as a part of this union,
Radagon's prior three children with Rennala

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:41.670
became demi-god step-children (Radahn's Great
Rune), granted grace thanks to their new..family

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:42.799
tree (They became demi-gods just as Godfrey
did, despite not being born into it).

00:20:42.799 --> 00:20:45.000
Rennala was broken by this.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.669
And so was her country.

00:20:46.669 --> 00:20:53.049
The Queen's Set reads "When Rennala, head
of both the Academy of Raya Lucaria and the

00:20:53.049 --> 00:20:58.580
Carian Royal Family, lost her husband Radagon,
her heart went along with him.

00:20:58.580 --> 00:21:00.809
And then, those at the academy realized.

00:21:00.809 --> 00:21:04.110
That Rennala was no champion, after all".

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:09.480
In the wake of Radagon's betrayal and Rennala's
poor judgement, Liurnia struggled with civil

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:15.930
war - with the Acadamy of Raya Lucaria on
one side, and the Carian Royals on the other.

00:21:15.930 --> 00:21:16.930
---

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:24.080
It's at this point - right here ... that Lunar
Princess Ranni, daughter of Rennala and Radagon..stole

00:21:24.080 --> 00:21:26.460
a fragment of the Rune of Death.

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:33.059
It happened during the Golden Age of the Erdtree,
long before the shattering of the Elden Ring.

00:21:33.059 --> 00:21:37.800
Someone stole a fragment of the Rune of Death
from Maliketh, the Black Blade.

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:43.720
As mentioned previously, Maliketh was Marika's
shadow, and he had sealed away Destined Death

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:45.000
in a black blade.

00:21:45.000 --> 00:21:54.970
Once a fragment of the rune of death was stolen
however, Maliketh went a step further.

00:21:54.970 --> 00:22:00.809
He bound the blade within his own flesh, such
that none might rob death, ever again (Maliketh's

00:22:00.809 --> 00:22:01.809
Black Blade).

00:22:01.809 --> 00:22:03.100
It was too late, however.

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:08.890
This fragment of the rune of death was used
immediately - to kill a demi-god.

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:11.280
Marika's own son, Godwyn the Golden.

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:15.920
That was the first recorded Death of a demigod
in all history.

00:22:15.920 --> 00:22:17.590
And it became the catalyst.

00:22:17.590 --> 00:22:24.730
Soon, the Elden Ring was smashed, and thus
sprang forth the war known as the Shattering.

00:22:24.730 --> 00:22:30.540
There is a lot of very credible evidence that
Marika was behind this plot.

00:22:30.540 --> 00:22:38.200
There's also a lot of evidence that Marika
is behind the entirety of your Tarnished quest

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:40.690
- but we'll talk about that in another video.

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:46.889
For now, all you need to know is this:

00:22:46.889 --> 00:22:47.889
---

00:22:47.889 --> 00:22:53.330
After the marriage of Marika and Radagon,
and after the Rune of Death was stolen, Marika

00:22:53.330 --> 00:22:55.960
went on to shatter the Elden Ring.

00:22:55.960 --> 00:22:58.500
And Radagon attempted to repair it (Marika's
Hammer).

00:22:58.500 --> 00:22:59.549
To no avail.

00:22:59.549 --> 00:23:03.460
The Elden Ring had been broken into runes
- some great, and some small.

00:23:03.460 --> 00:23:04.460
(Note: this was the Law of Causality put into
practice).

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:05.460
Even so, Order remained loosely held together
- for a time.

00:23:05.460 --> 00:23:06.460
In fact, I speculate that this is why the
Divine Towers were built.

00:23:06.460 --> 00:23:07.460
They're arranged in a ring, and there's one
Divine Tower for each Great Rune of the Elden

00:23:07.460 --> 00:23:08.460
Ring (except for the Omen Twins, whose Great
Runes are similar fragments, and Ranni, whose

00:23:08.460 --> 00:23:09.460
moon might have taken its benediction).

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:10.460
So that that even after the shattering, order
could be maintained.

00:23:10.460 --> 00:23:11.460
But order wasn't the only thing that was getting
forced back together..

00:23:11.460 --> 00:23:12.460
You know, it's said that Lord Radagon harboured
a secret...

00:23:12.460 --> 00:23:13.800
A famed sculptor of the Erdtree Capital was
once summoned to render Lord Radagon's likeness

00:23:13.800 --> 00:23:16.270
in giant stature.

00:23:16.270 --> 00:23:19.070
When he glimpsed the skeleton in Radagon's
closet.

00:23:19.070 --> 00:23:24.660
And as such, it's said the great statue harbours
his secret too.

00:23:24.660 --> 00:23:29.789
Of course, the big twist of Elden Ring.. is
that Radagon IS Marika.

00:23:29.789 --> 00:23:34.210
Or, depending on what you believe, he became
her.

00:23:34.210 --> 00:23:36.000
For she knew it was going to happen.

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:39.559
(Note: this was the Law of Regression in effect.

00:23:39.559 --> 00:23:40.789
All things yearn eternally to converge).

00:23:40.789 --> 00:23:44.730
O Radagon, leal hound of the Golden Order.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:52.930
Thou'rt yet to become me, thou'rt yet to become
a god.

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:58.130
Let us both be shattered, mine other half.

00:23:58.130 --> 00:24:03.919
Of all the unknowns in Elden Ring's lore,
this will surely go on to be one of the biggest,

00:24:03.919 --> 00:24:06.240
as we move forward.

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:13.530
The wording "thou'rt yet to become me" reinforces
that these were two separate entities before

00:24:13.530 --> 00:24:14.780
the shattering.

00:24:14.780 --> 00:24:20.320
However, in contrast, there is also evidence
that Radagon was always a part of Marika - for

00:24:20.320 --> 00:24:29.000
example, Enia says that all the demi-gods
are the direct offspring of Queen Marika..and

00:24:29.000 --> 00:24:36.330
the Mimic Veil reveals that Marika had a propensity
for imitation..so it's even possible that

00:24:36.330 --> 00:24:41.880
Radagon was an extension of Marika sent to
seduce Rennala, long ago.

00:24:41.880 --> 00:24:46.870
I'll present more concrete theories in the
future, but on this matter, the most important

00:24:46.870 --> 00:24:48.320
thing is...what do you think?

00:24:48.320 --> 00:24:52.020
The developers really respect your intelligence
and creativity in piecing the story together,

00:24:52.020 --> 00:24:58.820
as they've very carefully left certain things
open..and your imagination is a big part of

00:24:58.820 --> 00:25:00.380
what makes this story special.

00:25:00.380 --> 00:25:07.909
At any rate, the union of Radagon and Marika
seems to be a union of two fundamental opposing

00:25:07.909 --> 00:25:11.120
laws of the Golden Order.

00:25:11.120 --> 00:25:20.909
Causality, as Marika is an agent of cause
and effect.. and regression, as Radagon is

00:25:20.909 --> 00:25:28.320
a character who aspires to be complete in
all things (Radagon Icon).

00:25:28.320 --> 00:25:37.330
Fusing them together corrected Marika's deviance,
but even so, she was imprisoned in the Erdtree,

00:25:37.330 --> 00:25:38.870
for the shattering.

00:25:38.870 --> 00:25:43.140
'Marika's trespass demanded a heavy sentence.

00:25:43.140 --> 00:25:50.490
But even in shackles, she remains a god, and
the vision's vessel.'

00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:51.490
The Elden Ring had been shattered - though
there was still a period of relative peace

00:25:51.490 --> 00:25:52.490
here before the Shattering War began.

00:25:52.490 --> 00:25:56.030
In fact, the conjoined Radagon and Marika
even had two demi-god children of their own

00:25:56.030 --> 00:25:58.390
during this time: Miquella, and Malenia.

00:25:58.390 --> 00:26:01.000
these two children were born afflicted.

00:26:01.000 --> 00:26:07.159
Miquella was cursed with eternal childhood,
and Marika harboured a horrific rot within

00:26:07.159 --> 00:26:08.350
(Remembrance of the Rot Goddess).

00:26:08.350 --> 00:26:12.669
Even so, these two children were both chosen
as Empyreans.

00:26:12.669 --> 00:26:18.039
They were immensely sacred (Malenia's Great
Rune), and eligible to inherit godhood from

00:26:18.039 --> 00:26:19.600
the Greater Will.

00:26:19.600 --> 00:26:23.970
Perhaps the Greater Will was desperate to
find a worthy successor.

00:26:23.970 --> 00:26:29.200
Indeed, in the shattering war to come, many
would try to claim the shards of the Elden

00:26:29.200 --> 00:26:32.360
Ring, and take the throne.

00:26:32.360 --> 00:26:38.480
Including, of course - the Tarnished, returned
from their Long March..at long last -

00:26:38.480 --> 00:26:39.480
---

00:26:39.480 --> 00:26:40.960
Which we'll talk about in the next main lore
video.

00:26:40.960 --> 00:26:45.610
I should probably also mention here that if
you become a patron, you'll see upcoming lore

00:26:45.610 --> 00:26:50.070
videos early, as that's one of the rewards
if you pledge to the $3 tier.

00:26:50.070 --> 00:26:52.409
And if you really liked this video, then I've
actually also just added a new $20 tier as

00:26:52.409 --> 00:26:57.429
well - so that if you think my channel is
worth pledging to for that amount, then you'll

00:26:57.429 --> 00:27:02.850
receive a new mug with a unique design every
three months.

00:27:02.850 --> 00:27:09.169
There are four to collect - the first is inspired
by dark souls, then Elden Ring, then Sekiro,

00:27:09.169 --> 00:27:13.960
and finally Bloodborne - all with fantastic
art that I worked on with an amazing artist

00:27:13.960 --> 00:27:15.240
named "choo".

00:27:15.240 --> 00:27:44.720
The quality is really nice, and the prints
don't seem to come off at 

00:27:44.720 --> 00:28:18.710
all in the wash, which is great..not to mention
